Upstream: https://github.com/RawAccelOfficial/rawaccel

Refresh procedure (run_oracle.sh expects a fresh clone):
    git clone --depth 1 https://github.com/RawAccelOfficial/rawaccel.git /tmp/rr
    cp /tmp/rr/rawaccel/common/{rawaccel-base,math-vec2,utility,accel-classic,
        accel-jump,accel-synchronous,accel-lookup,accel-natural,accel-power,
        accel-noaccel,accel-union,rawaccel}.hpp .

The official headers are MSVC-flavoured; run_oracle.sh compiles them with
`-fpermissive -Wno-changes-meaning` and a small compatibility shim
(`__forceinline` → `inline`, `_copysign` → `std::copysign`). The reference math
is not modified.